      "text": "Congratulations to @CBPCommissioner Rodney S. Scott, who has officially taken the oath of office as Commissioner of U.S. Customs and Border Protection. It was my great honor to swear him in today.\n\nCommissioner Scott began his career with the U.S. Border Patrol 29 years ago at the Academy and, through steadfast service and proven leadership, rose to become the 24th Chief of the Border Patrol.\n\nWith his decades of frontline experience and unwavering commitment to law and order, Commissioner Scott will supercharge our work to make America safe again and serve @CBP — and our nation — with distinction.",
